    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100-a2">

                <pb facs="0106" n="100" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg100"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, His Imperial Majesty’s plenipotentiaries, have the honour to
                    acquaint their excellencies the plenipotentiaries of His Majesty the Emperor of
                    China that the meeting of the plenipotentiaries of the two powers is appointed
                    to take place at the Hiroshima Kencho on the 1st day of the 2nd month of the
                    28th year of Meiji, at 11 o’clock a.m.</p>
                <p>The undersigned will on that occasion be prepared to make with the Chinese
                    plenipotentiaries a reciprocal exchange of full powers.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>Count <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ito Hirobumi</hi>,</item>
                            <item>Viscount <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mutsu Munemitsu</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">H. I. M’s Plenipotentiaries.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Hiroshima</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="japanese-nengō" when="1895-01-31">the 31st day of the 1st
                            month of the 28th year of Meiji</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
